{"version":"2.0","class":"dataset","label":"HICP - annual data (average index and rate of change) (1996-2025)","source":"ESTAT","updated":"2026-02-06T23:00:00+0100","value":{"0":71.22,"1":73.23,"2":75.86,"3":78.21,"4":80.60,"5":83.33,"6":86.29,"7":88.75,"8":92.41,"9":92.19,"10":94.08,"11":96.94,"12":99.31,"13":100.83,"14":100.63,"15":100.00,"16":99.66,"17":101.69,"18":103.46,"19":104.26,"20":103.91,"21":107.04,"22":115.95,"23":119.89,"24":123.33,"25":126.65},"id":["freq","unit","coicop","geo","time"],"size":[1,1,1,1,26],"dimension":{"freq":{"label":"Time frequency","category":{"index":{"A":0},"label":{"A":"Annual"}}},"unit":{"label":"Unit of measure","category":{"index":{"INX_A_AVG":0},"label":{"INX_A_AVG":"Annual average index"}}},"coicop":{"label":"Classification of individual consumption by purpose (COICOP)","category":{"index":{"CP00":0},"label":{"CP00":"All-items HICP"}}},"geo":{"label":"Geopolitical entity (reporting)","category":{"index":{"ES":0},"label":{"ES":"Spain"}}},"time":{"label":"Time","category":{"index":{"2000":0,"2001":1,"2002":2,"2003":3,"2004":4,"2005":5,"2006":6,"2007":7,"2008":8,"2009":9,"2010":10,"2011":11,"2012":12,"2013":13,"2014":14,"2015":15,"2016":16,"2017":17,"2018":18,"2019":19,"2020":20,"2021":21,"2022":22,"2023":23,"2024":24,"2025":25},"label":{"2000":"2000","2001":"2001","2002":"2002","2003":"2003","2004":"2004","2005":"2005","2006":"2006","2007":"2007","2008":"2008","2009":"2009","2010":"2010","2011":"2011","2012":"2012","2013":"2013","2014":"2014","2015":"2015","2016":"2016","2017":"2017","2018":"2018","2019":"2019","2020":"2020","2021":"2021","2022":"2022","2023":"2023","2024":"2024","2025":"2025"}}}},"extension":{"lang":"EN","description":"<p>The Harmonised Index of Consumer Prices (HICP) measures price changes of various consumer goods and services over time (inflation). This dataset&nbsp;comprises:&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><ul><li>the average index, which is the average of the monthly HICP indices in a calendar year, and&nbsp;&nbsp;</li><li>the annual average rate of change, which is the average of the monthly consumer price indices over a calendar year compared to the average of the monthly consumer price indices over the previous calendar year</li></ul><p>Please note that this dataset is discontinued and replaced by <a href=\"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/bookmark/f7a8b7e0-9b0e-4652-a82b-ad4ffc058b1b?lang=en&amp;createdAt=2026-05-20T13:25:22Z\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">prc_hicp_ainr</a></p>","id":"PRC_HICP_AIND","agencyId":"ESTAT","version":"1.0","datastructure":{"id":"PRC_HICP_AIND","agencyId":"ESTAT","version":"59.0"},"annotation":[{"type":"CREATED","date":"2015-11-16T10:20:47+0100"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_DOI_XML","title":"<adms:identifier xmlns:adms=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#\" xmlns:skos=\"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core.html\" xmlns:dct=\"http://purl.org/dc/terms/\" xmlns:rdf=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#\"><adms:Identifier rdf:about=\"https://doi.org/10.2908/PRC_HICP_AIND\"><skos:notation rdf:datatype=\"http://purl.org/spar/datacite/doi\">10.2908/PRC_HICP_AIND</skos:notation><dct:creator rdf:resource=\"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/corporate-body/ESTAT\"/><dct:issued rdf:datatype=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date\">2023-01-23</dct:issued></adms:Identifier></adms:identifier>"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_EXPLANATORY_LINK","title":"text-category","href":"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser-backend/api/public/explanatory-notes/get/Info_note_HICP_COICOP18_20260128.pdf","text":"Information note"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_EXPLANATORY_LINK","title":"text-category","href":"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser-backend/api/public/explanatory-notes/get/Info_note_HICP_COICOP18_20260128.pdf"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_EXPLANATORY_LINK","title":"text-category","href":"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser-backend/api/public/explanatory-notes/get/Info_note_HICP_COICOP18_20260128.pdf"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_OBJECT_TYPE",